# BetterCP/M Help

Choose a group, or type HELP followed by a command name at the CP/M prompt.

## Files and users

- [COPY](COPY.HLP) Copy files.
- [DIR](DIR.HLP) Directory listing.
- [ERA](ERA.HLP) Erase selected files.
- [MOVE](MOVE.HLP) Move files between locations.
- [PIP](PIP.HLP) File and device transfer.
- [REN](REN.HLP) Rename files in place.
- [SEARCH](SEARCH.HLP) Find text or bytes in files.
- [TYPE](TYPE.HLP) Display a text file.
- [USER](USER.HLP) Select a numbered user area.

## Disks and setup

- [CONFIG](CONFIG.HLP) Configure startup and disk bindings.
- [DUP](DUP.HLP) Check, format or copy a disk.
- [FDB](FDB.HLP) Edit the disk format catalogue.
- [NDR](NDR.HLP) Name drive and user locations.
- [PATH](PATH.HLP) Command search path.
- [STAT](STAT.HLP) Disk, file and memory status.
- [SYSGEN](SYSGEN.HLP) Install or export a boot system.
- [TIME](TIME.HLP) Read or set the clock.
- [VER](VER.HLP) Identify the running system.

## Inspect files

- [COMPARE](COMPARE.HLP) Compare two files byte by byte.
- [CRCKSUM](CRCKSUM.HLP) Calculate and check file checksums.
- [DUMP](DUMP.HLP) Inspect file bytes.
- [MD5SUM](MD5SUM.HLP) Make or verify an MD5 list.
- [PATCH](PATCH.HLP) Apply a verified binary patch.

## Batch and system

- [CLS](CLS.HLP) Clear the console.
- [CPX](CPX.HLP) Manage command processor extensions.
- [HELP](HELP.HLP) Browse online help.
- [RSX](RSX.HLP) Manage resident extensions.
- [SUBMIT](SUBMIT.HLP) Run commands from a file.
- [XSUB](XSUB.HLP) Feed submitted lines to a program.

## Edit and build

- [DASM](DASM.HLP) Disassemble a Z80 binary.
- [DDT](DDT.HLP) Debug an 8080 program.
- [DLINK](DLINK.HLP) Link and capture a checked report.
- [DSYM](DSYM.HLP) Convert a linker report to DASM symbols.
- [ED](ED.HLP) Edit text with the line editor.
- [LINK](LINK.HLP) Link relocatable object modules.
- [TED](TED.HLP) Edit text on screen.
- [ZSM4](ZSM4.HLP) Assemble a Z80 source file.

## Archives

- [CR](CR.HLP) Crunch one file.
- [LZH](LZH.HLP) Compress a file in CrLZH format.
- [NOAH](NOAH.HLP) Archive utility.
- [SQ](SQ.HLP) Squeeze one file.
- [UNCR](UNCR.HLP) Restore a crunched file.
- [UNLZH](UNLZH.HLP) Restore a CrLZH file.
- [USQ](USQ.HLP) Restore a squeezed file.

## Memory commands

- [GET](GET.HLP) Load a file into memory.
- [GO](GO.HLP) Execute a program at 0100H.
- [JUMP](JUMP.HLP) Execute at a chosen address.
- [PEEK](PEEK.HLP) Inspect memory in hexadecimal.
- [POKE](POKE.HLP) Change bytes in memory.
- [SAVE](SAVE.HLP) Write memory pages to a file.

## Terminal tests

- [ADMTST](ADMTST.HLP) Exercise the ADM3A personality.
- [ANSITST](ANSITST.HLP) Exercise the ANSI personality.
- [VT52TST](VT52TST.HLP) Exercise the VT52 personality.

## cpmsim host

- [BYE](BYE.HLP) Exit cpmsim.
- [MOUNT](MOUNT.HLP) Mount a host image in cpmsim.
- [R](R.HLP) Import a host file into cpmsim.
- [W](W.HLP) Export a cpmsim file to the host.
